{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y为了突出重点压缩了部分因果背景，个别段落中人物为什么产生某种念头、为什么发生转变，交代不如X完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词突出，话与感受交替出现，扫屏时更容易迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化；感受文字又有大小层次和音乐到时提示，既不容易淹没叙事，也更容易在听觉与画面之间建立联系。尤其是小船、摇荡、水波、浪潮、铁锚等意象的反复呼应，让情绪变化有了连续的感官脉络，细节也更贴近具体的音乐表现。X的优势是人物动机和心理因果交代得更充分，但双栏信息竞争、右侧短词较多，部分感受偏抽象或重复，整体不如Y容易扫读和形成连贯体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "24d6b1df-af72-4cae-8575-4e89a32db572", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T051958208664Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:20:24.809209+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c0d0f9c120d17ca9ea110135dc2d6f2d930e0028d6a1f95567aa09c97dc7f744", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 